// Regla Sigma: proc_creation_win_whoami_groups_discovery.yml
// ID Sigma: bd8b828d-0dca-48e1-8a63-8a58ecf2644f
// Título: Group Membership Reconnaissance Via Whoami.EXE
// Descripción: Detects the execution of whoami.exe with the /group command line flag to show group membership for the current user, account type, security identifiers (SID), and attributes.
// Aplica a: Producto: windows | Categoría: process_creation
// Producto: windows
// Categoría: process_creation
// Servicio: 
// Nivel: medium
// Pipeline: microsoft_xdr
// Ruta original: C:\SigmaLab\sigma\rules\windows\process_creation\proc_creation_win_whoami_groups_discovery.yml
// Requiere validación en el entorno de destino.

DeviceProcessEvents
| where (FolderPath endswith "\\whoami.exe" or ProcessVersionInfoOriginalFileName =~ "whoami.exe") and (ProcessCommandLine contains " /groups" or ProcessCommandLine contains " -groups")
